  "question": {
    "text": "The total kinetic energy of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn></math> mole of oxygen at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>27</mn><mo>°</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math> is :<br/>[Use universal gas constant <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>31</mn><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi><mo> </mo><msup><mi>mol</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo> </mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math> ]"
